<view class="page"><demo-banner/><view class="eyebrow">STORE WORKSPACE</view><view class="title">门店工作台</view><view class="subtitle">{{store.name}} · 服务好每一位邻居</view><view class="section-title row"><text>新客户提醒</text><view class="badge">近期未读 {{unread}}</view></view><view class="card"><view wx:if="{{!notifications.length}}" class="muted">暂时没有注册提醒</view><view wx:for="{{notifications}}" wx:key="_id" class="notice"><view class="row"><text>{{item.nickname}} · {{item.park}}</text><view class="dot" wx:if="{{item.unread}}"></view></view><view class="meta">{{item.title}} · {{item.time}}</view></view><button class="secondary small" wx:if="{{unread}}" bindtap="read" loading="{{reading}}" disabled="{{reading}}">将已显示提醒标为已读</button></view><view class="meta">显示最近20条；工作台打开时约每15秒检查新注册。</view><view class="section-title row"><text>客户列表</text><text class="link" bindtap="refresh">刷新</text></view><view class="card" wx:for="{{customers}}" wx:key="_id"><view class="row"><text>{{item.nickname}}</text><view class="tag">{{item.park}}</view></view><view class="muted">{{item.phone}} · {{item.gender}}</view><view class="danger" wx:if="{{!item.enabled}}">账户已停用</view><button wx:if="{{user.role === 'store' && item.enabled}}" class="secondary" data-id="{{item._id}}" bindtap="chat">发起对话 →</button></view><view class="empty" wx:if="{{!loading && !customers.length}}">客户注册后会出现在这里</view><button wx:if="{{more}}" class="secondary" bindtap="customers">更多客户</button><view class="loading" wx:if="{{loading}}">正在加载…</view><view class="error" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view></view>